msgid "Load"
msgstr "加载"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:336
msgid ""
"Choose a SVG file created from Slic3r or Skeinforge, a PrusaSlicer SL1-file "
"or a zip file of bitmap images (.3dlp.zip)."
msgstr ""
"选择由 Slic3r 或 Skeinforge 生成的 SVG 文件、PrusaSlicer SL1 文件或包含位图的 ZIP "
"文件（.3dlp.zip）。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:341
msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:343
msgid "Starts the presentation of the slices."
msgstr "开始逐层投影。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:350
msgid ""
"Pauses the presentation. Can be resumed afterwards by clicking this button, "
"or restarted by clicking start again."
msgstr "暂停投影。再次点击此按钮可继续，或点击开始重新投影。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:356 printrun/projectlayer.py:1118
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:358
msgid "Stops presenting the slices."
msgstr "停止逐层投影。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:374
msgid ""
"The thickness of each slice. Should match the value used to slice the model."
" SVG files update this value automatically, 3dlp.zip files have to be "
"manually entered."
msgstr "每层切片的厚度，应与模型切片时的设置一致。SVG 文件自动更新此值，3dlp.zip 文件需手动输入。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:384
msgid "How long each slice should be displayed."
msgstr "每层切片的显示时间。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:393
msgid ""
"The pause length between slices. This should take into account any movement "
"of the Z axis, plus time to prepare the resin surface (sliding, tilting, "
"sweeping, etc)."
msgstr "切片之间的暂停时间，应包含 Z 轴移动及树脂表面准备时间（滑动、倾斜、刮平等）。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:403
msgid "The additional scaling of each slice."
msgstr "每层切片的额外缩放比例。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:419
msgid ""
"The direction the Z axis should move. Top Down is where the projector is "
"above the model, Bottom up is where the projector is below the model."
msgstr "Z 轴移动方向。自上而下表示投影仪在模型上方，自下而上表示投影仪在模型下方。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:429
msgid ""
"How far the axis should move beyond the next slice position for each slice. "
"For Top Down printers this would dunk the model under the resi and then "
"return. For Bottom Up printers this would raise the base away from the vat "
"and then return."
msgstr "每层超出下一层位置的移动距离。自上而下的打印机将模型浸入树脂后返回；自下而上的打印机将平台抬离树脂槽后返回。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:438
msgid ""
"Additional gcode to run before raising the Z-axis. Be sure to take into "
"account any additional time needed in the pause value, and be careful what "
"gcode is added!"
msgstr "抬升 Z 轴前执行的额外 G-Code。请将额外耗时计入暂停时间，并谨慎添加代码！"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:448
msgid ""
"Additional gcode to run after raising the Z-axis. Be sure to take into "
"account any additional time needed in the pause value, and be careful what "
"gcode is added!"
msgstr "抬升 Z 轴后执行的额外 G-Code。请将额外耗时计入暂停时间，并谨慎添加代码！"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:459
msgid "The projector resolution in the X axis."
msgstr "投影仪 X 方向的分辨率。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:466
msgid "The projector resolution in the Y axis."
msgstr "投影仪 Y 方向的分辨率。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:475
msgid "How far the slice should be offset from the edge in the X axis."
msgstr "切片在 X 方向相对边缘的偏移距离。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:484
msgid "How far the slice should be offset from the edge in the Y axis."
msgstr "切片在 Y 方向相对边缘的偏移距离。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:493
msgid ""
"The actual width of the entire projected image. Use the Calibrate grid to "
"show the full size of the projected image, and measure the width at the same"
" level where the slice will be projected onto the resin."
msgstr "整幅投影图像的实际宽度。使用校准网格显示完整投影，在树脂曝光平面所在高度测量宽度。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:503
msgid ""
"Speed of the Z axis in mm/minute. Take into account that slower rates may "
"require a longer pause value."
msgstr "Z 轴速度，单位 mm/min。较慢的速度可能需要更长的暂停时间。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:510
msgid "Display"
msgstr "显示"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:514
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:516
msgid "Toggles the project screen to full size."
msgstr "切换投影窗口的全屏显示。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:520
msgid "Calibrate"
msgstr "校准"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:529
msgid "1st Layer"
msgstr "首层"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:531
msgid ""
"Displays the first layer of the model. Use this to project the first layer "
"for longer so it holds to the base. Note: this value does not affect the "
"first layer when the 'Start' run is started, it should be used manually."
msgstr "显示模型第一层，可手动延长投影时间，使其牢固附着在平台上。此值不影响点击“开始”后的第一层曝光，仅用于手动操作。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:541
msgid "How long to display the first layer for. -1 = unlimited."
msgstr "第一层显示时间。-1 表示不限时。"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:546
msgid "Red"
msgstr "红色"

#: printrun/projectlayer.py:548
msgid ""
"Toggles whether the image should be red. Useful for positioning whilst resin"
" is in the printer as it should not cause a reaction."
msgstr "切换红色图像。打印机内有树脂时可用于定位，通常不会引发固化反应。"

